{"title":"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> be positive real numbers which satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/7/1f7387e3e1148b2a4a6d7964d843fe696380387e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(a^2+b^2+c^2)&lt;6(ab+bc+ca)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"256\" height=\"19\" />. Prove that these three inequalities hold: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/343a8ee963a58a46605b3350c32b1a2b2ef4c5db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b&gt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/92517f1f9ab681652c5c0ab5831b8429b8d6a263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c&gt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/5/9d548f0f715d10e83697fa417272505d696c0242.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+a&gt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.28credit_to_vedran6.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_(credit_to_vedran6)\">Solution (credit to vedran6)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution (credit to vedran6)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/b/b7b0fb2c4db0925b7b027cb607f028e4cb765c6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b \\le c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/6/a66692b6ce3cf2e82cdc4059b12a68b170cf0225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-a-b \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889db364e6377ffd84409513dc4e6a2e70395421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = c-a-b$\" width=\"104\" height=\"12\" />, making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/f/dff5a847457c4beaa2c6809fc9d7b26ebcaa398e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ff9d48d5e4c62c362730b32f9a8a2c85178e7ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a+b+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nBy substitution, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/e/2be42b963852c9ead91b2b637144b5d265349b5e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 5(a^2 + b^2 + (a+b+x)^2) &amp;&lt; 6(ab + (a+b)(a+b+x)) \\\\ 5(a^2 + b^2 + a^2 + b^2 + x^2 + 2ab + 2ax + 2bx) &amp;&lt; 6(ab + a^2 + ab + ax + ab + b^2 + bx) \\\\ 5(2a^2 + 2b^2 + x + 2ab + 2ax + 2bx) &amp;&lt; 6(3ab + a^2 + ax + b^2 + bx) \\\\ 10a^2 + 10b^2 + 5x + 10ab + 10ax + 10bx &amp;&lt; 18ab+6a^2+6ax+6b^2+6bx \\\\ 4a^2 + 4b^2 + 5x - 8ab + 4ax + 4bx &amp;&lt; 0 \\\\ 4(a-b)^2 + x(5+4a+4b) &amp;&lt; 0 \\end{align*}\" width=\"646\" height=\"157\" />\nNote that because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58d459a2332e764539721a6855662804739842c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, a, b \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1cab3266c0bb3328ee075fa93e3f7760da41c6a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(5+4a+4b) \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />.  Additionally, by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trivial_Inequality\" title=\"Trivial Inequality\">Trivial Inequality</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/3/d5321f29e138390f16aee2041e13516387b921cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(a-b)^2 \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"19\" />.  Thus, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e5d8467b64008c8ec97e7023357b626d4a98d5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(a-b)^2 + x(5+4a+4b) \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"239\" height=\"19\" />, is a contradiction.  Therefore, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc44577da86db8641a5611b2ba63c24e52384f9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b &gt; c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nBecause of symmetry in the equation, we can use similar steps to prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/92517f1f9ab681652c5c0ab5831b8429b8d6a263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c&gt;a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/5/9d548f0f715d10e83697fa417272505d696c0242.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+a&gt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO\">2007 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017032819\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 s